&lt;h4 id="a-67-year-old-woman-whose-chief-complaint-is-that-she-suddenly-passed-out-while-exercising-just-now"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A 67-year-old woman whose chief complaint is that she suddenly passed out while exercising just now.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There are lots of causes of syncope, but &lt;strong&gt;the final common pathway is an interruption of cerebral blood flow for about 10 seconds&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;sup id="fnref:1"&gt;&lt;a href="#fn:1" class="footnote-ref" role="doc-noteref"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
